  "video_link": "",
  "rating": "5",
  "item_short_desc": "<p>Combat the elements with our iconic MA-1 Flight Jacket with Morale Patches, equipped with warm poly fiberfill for exceptional insulation, keeping you warm in cold conditions. The military-styled bomber jacket features a nylon water-repellent outer shell that provides protection from light rain and snow.</p>",
  "no_ratings": null,
  "sort_order": "197",
  "description": "<p>Combat the elements with our iconic MA-1 Flight Jacket with Morale Patches, equipped with warm poly fiberfill for exceptional insulation, keeping you warm in cold conditions. The military-styled bomber jacket features a nylon water-repellent outer shell that provides protection from light rain and snow. Unbeatable Comfort and Warmth: These aviator flight jackets feature a soft ribbed knit collar, cuffs, and waistband for additional heat retention and insulation while blocking out the wind. The MA-1 military bomber jacket has an extra full cut for a comfortable fit with room underneath for extra layers, ideal for winter and cold weather. Utility Pockets: The military pilot&rsquo;s coat comes equipped with 5 pockets: 2 front slash pockets and 2 inner welt pockets for everyday essentials, and what&rsquo;s a bomber jacket without a zippered utility sleeve pocket!? Along with exterior pen holders, this useful pocket is great for storing small items. Iconic MA-1 Styling: Inspired by the original design for fighter pilots, our rugged and dependable MA-1 Flight Bomber Jackets feature a reversible orange polyester lining that offers alternative style options. The zippered front closure with double &lsquo;MA-1&rsquo; pull tabs and storm flap, brass zippers, and leather pull tab pays homage to the jacket&rsquo;s heritage, functionality, and style. Take Flight: Whether you are active-duty personnel, aviation enthusiast, or outdoor adventurer, the pilot bomber jacket is perfect as a windbreaker for spring and fall seasons while presenting a classic style that is great for casual outings and everyday use.</p>",
